Hello <div><p>I have been trying to activate the PARDISO license in my <strong>R-INLA</strong> package, but every time I try, it doesn’t work and keeps giving me an error.</p>
<p>My <strong>R</strong> version is <strong>4.5.1</strong> and my <strong>INLA</strong> version is <strong>25.06.13</strong>.</p>
